---
title: Publishing an email
endpoint: /emails/{id}/publish
method: post
---

Publishes and sends an email.

If you provide a `publish_date`, the email becomes scheduled to publish and send at that time. If you omit the `publish_date`, the email is set to publish immediately.

This endpoint accepts the same payload as [updating an email](/api-emails-update), so any other fields you include are applied before the email is published.
